This folder contains primary data of the bilateral trade datasets, sourced from ITC Trade Map. 

In this folder, the separate primary datasets of the bilateral trade among countries can be found in two parts for both export and import. 

The ITC Trade Map does not allow for both trade actions (1. import and 2. export) to be downloaded simultaneoulsy. 
Moreover, the entire duration (25 years) is also divided into two splits while downloading. 
Hence, each country has in total at best 4 primary datasets in csv format, which were converted to STATA data file (.dta) format and uploaded in this folder. 
For the users, it is advised to use the '.dta' files because we have cleaned the datasets from the .csv formats and dropped the anomalies,
and maintained the consistency across the datasets. The compiled dataset of each trade action for the countries can be found in this folder as well. Please
note the commit message for the compiled datasets along with the file name where no split number is included. For example, "Malaysia_1st_export.dta" is the 1st
split of Malaysia's export but "Malaysia_Draft_Export.dta" is the compiled export dataset of Malaysia. 
